# Wi-Fi networks where the WireGuard tunnel stays DOWN.
# Installed to /etc/wg-ssid/trusted (root:root 0644); edit with
#   sudoedit /etc/wg-ssid/trusted
#
# One SSID per line, matched exactly (case-sensitive). Blank lines and lines
# starting with # are ignored, and surrounding whitespace is trimmed.
#
# Every Wi-Fi network NOT listed here raises the tunnel. List at least the
# network your VPN server sits on: connecting to it from inside asks the router
# to hairpin its own public address, which most home routers cannot do.
#
# The dispatcher, wg-toggle and the bar widget all read this one file.
#
# Example:
#   Home Wi-Fi
#   Home Wi-Fi 5G
